  "analysis_md": "解答 $I=\\int_0^1\\sqrt{x^2}\\sqrt{1+y'^2}\\,dx=\\int_0^1x\\sqrt{1+4x^2}\\,dx$\n\n$$\n=\\frac{1}{8}\\int_0^1(1+4x^2)^{\\frac{1}{2}}d(1+4x^2)=\\frac{1}{12}(1+4x^2)^{\\frac{3}{2}}\\Big|_0^1=\\frac{5\\sqrt{5}-1}{12}\n$$",
